T*
(12. Business Rules To Enforce) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(12.1 Time Off Rules) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- cannot request leave for inactive employee) Tj
T*
(- cannot approve beyond available balance if balance-controlled leave type) Tj
T*
(- cannot create overlapping pending full-day leave for same date) Tj
T*
(- hourly leave must stay inside shift window rules if policy requires) Tj
T*
(- only HR/admin can approve or reject) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(12.2 Regularization Rules) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- employee can only request for allowed past date window) Tj
T*
(- duplicate pending request should be blocked) Tj
T*
(- approved correction must update final attendance summary) Tj
T*
(- rejected request must remain visible in history) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(12.3 Master Data Rules) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- inactive master records should not appear in new form dropdowns) Tj
T*
(- old employee records should still remain readable even if master record later becomes) Tj
T*
(  inactive) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(12.4 Notification Rules) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Create notifications for:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- new time off request submitted) Tj
T*
(- time off request approved/rejected) Tj
T*
(- new regularization request submitted) Tj
T*
(- regularization approved/rejected) Tj
T*
(- suspicious login or login activity event if product keeps that behavior) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(12.5 Validation Rules The Backend Must Enforce) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Never trust frontend validation alone.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Time Off Validation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `leaveTypeId` must exist) Tj
T*
(- `dateFrom` cannot be after `dateTo`) Tj
T*
(- `reason` cannot be blank) Tj
T*
(- if `durationType = hourly`, then `startTime` and `endTime` are required) Tj
T*
(- `approvedHours` cannot be greater than `requestedHours`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Regularization Validation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- at least one of `requestedPunchIn` or `requestedPunchOut` should be present) Tj
T*
(- request date should belong to employee attendance-access window) Tj
T*
(- employee must exist and be active) Tj
T*
(- duplicate pending request for same date should fail) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Master Data Validation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
